Bad Piggies – This is a virtual adventure about the dastardly pigs from the Angry Birds universe. However, this time, users will have a standalone adventure that will allow them to learn the pigs' history and offer to help them hunt for the birds' eggs.

In addition to the eggs themselves, the pigs will have to collect various bonuses, complete challenges, and demonstrate their ingenuity in creating various inventions. For example, they can create enormous walking robots that can not only move quickly but also fly. The pigs have proven to be interesting and original inventors, so it's worth giving them credit and taking on their role yourself.

Over 140 levels await you, with a variety of paths to complete and endless adrenaline-fueled fun. Each level can be replayed multiple times, improving your performance and earning various bonuses with each attempt. Besides all the advantages, it's worth noting that downloading Bad Piggies Everyone needs to play this game via torrent, as it's truly interesting, engaging, and even educational. You'll be creating various inventions from scratch, and that's worth a lot. Happy gaming!

Features of the game project:
- universal gameplay;
- interesting and attractive graphics;
- a huge set of different levels;
- a wide choice in terms of creating your own transport;
- a wide range of tests and tasks;
- positive sound accompaniment.

